{
  "Scenes.Mutations.LizardHairChange.Line567": "\n"
  "Scenes.Mutations.LizardHairChange.SuddenSharpPainDrills": "[pg]A sudden sharp pain drills through your skull, a pressure forming across your scalp. If you didn't know any better you'd think you were being plucked!"
  "Scenes.Mutations.LizardHairChange.ThePinYourHair": "[pg]The pin in your hair heats up to the point where you have to pull it free and toss it to the ground, it sizzling against the earth."
  "Scenes.Mutations.LizardHairChange.ThePinYourHairHeats": "[pg]The pin in your hair heats up to the point where you have to pull it free and toss it to the ground, it sizzling against the earth."
  "Scenes.Mutations.LizardHairChange.ThePinYourHairHeatsThe": "[pg]The pin in your hair heats up to the point where you have to pull it free and toss it to the ground, it sizzling against the earth."
  "Scenes.Mutations.LizardHairChange.WhereYourHairWould": "[pg]<b>Where your hair would be, you now have a crown of dull reptilian spines!</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.LizardHairChange.YouClutchYourHead": "[pg]You clutch your head as you feel the feathers on your head push out further, thickening up as they do so. The soft vane seems to fall from the spine of the feathers, stripping them bare as the red fluff falls to the floor. Soon the tips of the feathers follow, leaving some rather alien looking spines behind. Your head throbs with dull pain as the transformation seems to end and you go to look at your reflection in a nearby puddle. Your once magnificent plume has turned into a dull crown of spines, like that of the corrupt basilisk of the mountains. As you mourn the loss of your feathered hair, you notice your spines move with your emotions, their sensitive tips picking up on the breeze as they lower closer to your skull."
  "Scenes.Mutations.LizardHairChange.YouPlaceTheHair": "[pg]You place the hair-pin in your inventory, no longer able to wear it."
  "Scenes.Mutations.LizardHairChange.YourGooeyHairBegins": "[pg]Your gooey hair begins to fall out in globs, eventually leaving you with a bald head."
  "Scenes.Mutations.LizardHairChange.YourGooeyHairBeginsFall": "[pg]Your gooey hair begins to fall out in globs, eventually leaving you with a bald head."
  "Scenes.Mutations.LizardHairChange.YourHairGrowingAgain": "[pg]<b>Your hair is growing again and is now a plume of short red feathers.</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.LizardHairChange.YourHairHasStopped": "[pg](<b>Your hair has stopped growing.</b>)"
  "Scenes.Mutations.LizardHairChange.YourHairNowPlume": "[pg]<b>Your hair is now a plume of short red feathers.</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.LizardHairChange.YourHeadBeginsTickle": "[pg]Your head begins to tickle and you reach up to scratch at it, only to be surprised by the softness you feel. It reminds you of the down of baby chickens, velvety soft and slightly fluffy. You look at yourself in a nearby puddle and gasp, [if (hairlength <= 0) {where your hair once was}] you now have red feathers, some longer and larger than others. This floppy but soft plume sits daintily on your head, reminding you of a ladies fascinator. You realize soon that"
  "Scenes.Mutations.LizardHairChange.YourScalpFeelsTight": "[pg]Your scalp feels tight and hot, causing you to run a hand through your [hair] to rub at it gingerly."
  "Scenes.Mutations.LizardHairChange.YourScalpFeelsTightThough": "[pg]Your scalp feels tight, as though the skin is shifting and morphing. You let out groan as you grip your head, praying for the pain to subside quickly. Pressure builds, your head feeling ready to split. As the sensation fades you're left wondering what just happened and you run to look at yourself in a nearby puddle."
  "Scenes.Mutations.LizardHairChange.YourScalpTinglesOddly": "[pg]Your scalp tingles oddly. In a panic, you reach up to your [hair], but thankfully it appears unchanged."
  "Scenes.Mutations.LizardHairChange.YourShockHandfulYour": "[pg]To your shock a handful of your [hair] comes loose, exposing the [skinFurScales] beneath. You wonder why this is happening to you but realize it must be the potion, lizards don't tend to have hair after all. You continue to rub at your scalp, the cool air against your slowly revealed skin a welcome relief. After several minutes of this, you're certain you've shed all your hair. When you think it's all over, you feel an uncomfortable pressure build, your scalp morphing and changing as you grimace. When the sensation finally fades you rush to look at yourself in a puddle. Where you once had hair, you now have a crown of dull reptilian spines!"
  "Scenes.Mutations.LizardHairChange.YourThoughtsWanderThe": "[pg]Your thoughts wander to the hair-pin while you adjust to your new [hair]. You probably won't be able to wear it while you're this tainted."
  "Scenes.Mutations.RemoveBlackNipples.NipplesNatural": "[pg]Something invisible brushes against your [nipple], making you twitch. Undoing your clothes, you take a look at your chest and find that your nipples have turned back to their natural flesh color."
  "Scenes.Mutations.RemoveWings.SharkFinGone": "[pg]A wave of tightness spreads through your back, and it feels as if someone is stabbing a dagger into your spine. <b>After a moment the pain passes, though your fin is gone!</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.RemoveWings.WingsGone": "[pg]A wave of tightness spreads through your back, and it feels as if someone is stabbing a dagger into each of your shoulder-blades. <b>After a moment the pain passes, though your wings are gone!</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.RemoveFeatheryHair.Long": "[pg]A lock of your downy-soft feather-hair droops over your eye. Before you can blow the offending down away, you realize the feather is collapsing in on itself. It continues to curl inward until all that remains is a normal strand of hair. <b>Your hair is no longer feathery!</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.RemoveFeatheryHair.Short": "[pg]You run your fingers through your downy-soft feather-hair while you await the effects of the item you just ingested. While your hand is up there, it detects a change in the texture of your feathers. They're completely disappearing, merging down into strands of regular hair. <b>Your hair is no longer feathery!</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.RemoveAntennae.InLine": " Antennae pop free, and float lightly down towards the floor. "
  "Scenes.Mutations.RemoveAntennae.Cockatrice": "[pg]You feel your antennae like feathers shrivel at the root, the pair of soft quills falling softly to the ground as your pores close."
  "Scenes.Mutations.RemoveAntennae.CockatriceLost": "\\n<b>You've lost your antennae like feathers!</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.RemoveAntennae.Bee": "[pg]Your [hair] itches so you give it a scratch, only to have your antennae fall to the ground. What a relief."
  "Scenes.Mutations.RemoveAntennae.BeeLost": "\\n<b>You've lost your antennae!</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.RemoveAntennae.Default": "[pg]The muscles in your brow clench tightly, and you feel a tremendous pressure on your upper forehead. When it passes, you touch yourself and discover <b>your antennae have vanished</b>!"
  "Scenes.Mutations.RemoveFur.Text": "[pg]Your skin suddenly feels itchy as your fur begins falling out in clumps, [b:revealing smooth skin] underneath."
  "Scenes.Mutations.RemoveScales.Text": "[pg]Your scales begin to itch as they begin falling out in droves, [b:revealing your smooth [skintone] skin] underneath."
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreLegs.Taur": "[pg]Your quadrupedal hind-quarters seizes, overbalancing your surprised front-end and causing you to stagger and fall to your side. Pain lances throughout, contorting your body into a tightly clenched ball of pain while tendons melt and bones break, melt, and regrow. When it finally stops, <b>you look down to behold your new pair of human legs</b>!"
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreLegs.Goo": "[pg]Your lower body rushes inward, molding into two leg-like shapes that gradually stiffen up. In moments they solidify into normal-looking legs, complete with regular, human feet. <b>You now have normal feet!</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreLegs.Naga": "[pg]You collapse as your sinuous snake-tail tears in half, shifting into legs. The pain is immense, particularly where your new feet are forming. <b>You have human legs again.</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreLegs.Mermaid": "[pg]You collapse as your mermaid tail tears in half, shifting into legs. The pain is immense, particularly where your new feet are forming. <b>You have human legs again.</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreLegs.Drider": "[pg]Your legs buckle under you and you fall, smashing your abdomen on the ground. Though your control deserts and you cannot see behind you, still you feel the disgusting sensation of chitin loosening and sloughing off your body, and the dry breeze on your exposed nerves. Reflexively, your legs cling together to protect as much of their now-sensitive surface as possible. When you try to part them, you find you cannot. Several minutes pass uncomfortably until you can again bend your legs, and when you do, you find that all the legs of a side bend together."
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreLegs.DriderHuman": " <b>You have human legs again.</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreLegs.NormalHummus": "[pg]You collapse as your legs shift and twist. By the time the pain subsides, you notice that you have normal legs and normal feet. <b>You now have normal feet!</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreRearBody.SharkFin": "A wave of tightness spreads through your back, and it feels as if someone is stabbing a dagger into your spine. After a moment the pain passes, though your fin is gone!"
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreRearBody.DraconicMane": "[pg]You feel a tingling just above your spine. Your glimpse at your back and see hair falling down from it. First in strands, then in bigger and bigger chunks until <b>your hairy draconic mane has completely disappeared.</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreRearBody.DraconicSpikes": "[pg]Your spine starts to make painful cracking sounds and you feel something retracting back into your rear. Soon after the pain ceased the skin above your spine fuses and closes the holes where your spikes once were. <b>The spikes on your rear have disappeared.</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreRearBody.Bark": "[pg]The bark coating you begins to split, and a rush of air touches the newly-exposed [skindesc] beneath. The splitting continues down, and soon the bark flakes and falls away, forming a pile of wood chips around your [feet]."
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreNeck.Draconic": "[pg]<b>Your draconic neck to its normal length.</b> "
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreNeck.Cockatrice": "[pg]You neck starts to tingle and the feathers that decorate your neck begin to fall out until <b>you're left with a normal neck!</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.RemoveBassyHair.PlumeLong": "[pg]A lock of your feathery plume droops over your eye. Before you can blow the offending down away, you realize the feather is collapsing in on itself. It continues to curl inward until all that remains is a normal strand of hair."
  "Scenes.Mutations.RemoveBassyHair.PlumeShort": "[pg]You run your fingers through your feathery plume while you await the effects of the item you just ingested. While your hand is up there, it detects a change in the texture of your feathers. They're completely disappearing, merging down into strands of regular hair."
  "Scenes.Mutations.RemoveBassyHair.PlumeGone": "[pg]<b>Your hair is no longer feathery!</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.RemoveBassyHair.Spines": "[pg]You feel a tingling on your scalp. You reach up to your basilisk spines to find out what is happening. The moment your hand touches a spine, it comes loose and falls in front of you. One after another the other spines fall out, until all the spines that once decorated your head now lay around you, leaving you with a bald head."
  "Scenes.Mutations.RemoveBassyHair.SpinesRegrow": "[pg]<b>You realize, that you'll grow normal human hair again!</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.GrowDemonCock.Base": "[pg]You shudder as a pressure builds in your crotch, peaking painfully as a large bulge begins to push out from your body. "
  "Scenes.Mutations.GrowDemonCock.Single": "The skin seems to fold back as a fully formed demon-cock bursts forth from your loins, drizzling hot cum everywhere as it orgasms. In time it fades to a more normal coloration and human-like texture. "
  "Scenes.Mutations.GrowDemonCock.Multiple": "The skin bulges obscenely, darkening and splitting around {0} of your new dicks. For an instant they turn a demonic purple and dribble in thick spasms of scalding demon-cum. After, they return to a more humanoid coloration. "
  "Scenes.Mutations.GrowDemonCock.Sensitive": "Your tender bundle of new cocks feels deliciously sensitive, and you cannot stop yourself from wrapping your hands around the slick demonic bundle and pleasuring them.[pg]Nearly an hour later, you finally pull your slick body away from the puddle you left on the ground. When you look back, you notice it has already been devoured by the hungry earth."
  "Scenes.Mutations.GainSnakeTongue.Human1": "[pg]Your taste-buds start aching as they swell to an uncomfortably large size. Trying to understand what in the world could have provoked such a reaction, you bring your hands up to your mouth, your tongue feeling like it's trying to push its way past your lips."
  "Scenes.Mutations.GainSnakeTongue.Human2": " The soreness stops and you stick out your tongue to try and see what would have made it feel the way it did. As soon as you stick your tongue out you realize that it sticks out much further than it did before, and now appears to have split at the end, creating a forked tip."
  "Scenes.Mutations.GainSnakeTongue.Human3": " <b>The scents in the air are much more noticeable to you with your snake-like tongue.</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.GainSnakeTongue.Inhuman1": "[pg]Your inhuman tongue shortens, pulling tight in the very back of your throat."
  "Scenes.Mutations.GainSnakeTongue.Inhuman2": " After a moment the bunched-up tongue-flesh begins to flatten out, then extend forwards."
  "Scenes.Mutations.GainSnakeTongue.Inhuman3": " By the time the transformation has finished, <b>your tongue has changed into a long, forked snake-tongue.</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.GainLizardTongue.Intro": "[pg]Your tongue goes numb, making your surprised noise little more than a gurgle as your tongue flops comically. "
  "Scenes.Mutations.GainLizardTongue.FromSnake": "[pg]Slowly your tongue swells, thickening up until it's about as thick as your thumb, while staying quite flexible. You drool, your tongue lolling out of your mouth as you slowly begin to regain control of your forked organ. When you retract your tongue however, you are shocked to find it is much longer than it used to be, now a foot long."
  "Scenes.Mutations.GainLizardTongue.FromDemonic": "[pg]Your tongue gently shrinks down, the thick appendage remaining flexible but getting much smaller. There's little you can do but endure the weird pinching feeling as your tongue eventually settles at being a foot long. The pinching sensation continues as the tip of your tongue morphs, becoming a distinctly forked shape. As you inspect your tongue you slowly regain control, retracting it into your mouth, the forked tips picking up on things you couldn't taste before."
  "Scenes.Mutations.GainLizardTongue.FromDraconic": "[pg]Your tongue rapidly shrinks down, the thick appendage remaining flexible but getting much smaller. There's little you can do but endure the weird pinching feeling as your tongue eventually settles at being a foot long. The pinching sensation continues as the tip of your tongue morphs, becoming a distinctly forked shape. As you inspect your tongue you slowly regain control, retracting it into your mouth, the forked tips picking up on things you couldn't taste before."
  "Scenes.Mutations.GainLizardTongue.FromEchidna": "[pg]Slowly your tongue swells, thickening up until it's about as thick as your thumb, while staying long. The tip pinches making you wince, morphing into a distinctly forked shape. As you inspect your tongue you slowly regain control, retracting it into your mouth, the forked tips picking up on things you couldn't taste before."
  "Scenes.Mutations.GainLizardTongue.Default": "[pg]Slowly your tongue swells, thickening up until it's about as thick as your thumb, filling your mouth as you splutter. It begins lengthening afterwards, continuing until it hangs out your mouth, settling at 1 foot long. The tip pinches making you wince, morphing into a distinctly forked shape. As you inspect your tongue you slowly regain control, retracting it into your mouth, the forked tips picking up on things you couldn't taste before."
  "Scenes.Mutations.GainLizardTongue.Done": "[pg]<b>You now have a lizard tongue!</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreNeck.DraconicPosition": "[pg]<b>Your draconic neck and its position on your head reverts to its normal position and length.</b> "
  "Scenes.Mutations.UpdateGills.NoneFromAnemone": "[pg]Your chest itches, and as you reach up to scratch it, you realize your gills have withdrawn into your skin."
  "Scenes.Mutations.UpdateGills.NoneFromGills": "[pg]You feel your gills tighten, the slits seeming to close all at once. As you let out a choked gasp your gills shrink into nothingness, leaving only smooth skin behind. Seems you won't be able to stay in the water quite so long anymore."
  "Scenes.Mutations.UpdateGills.NoLonger": " <b>You no longer have gills!</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.UpdateGills.AnemoneFromGills": "[pg]You feel your gills tighten, the slits seeming to close all at once. As you let out a choked gasp your gills shrink into nothingness, leaving only smooth skin behind. When you think it's over you feel something emerge from under your neck, flowing down over your chest and brushing your nipples. You look in surprise as your new feathery gills finish growing out, a film of mucus forming over them shortly after."
  "Scenes.Mutations.UpdateGills.AnemoneFromNone": "[pg]You feel a pressure in your lower esophageal region and pull your garments down to check the area. Before your eyes a pair of feathery gills start to push out of the center of your chest, just below your neckline, parting sideways and draping over your {0}s. They feel a bit uncomfortable in the open air at first, but soon a thin film of mucus covers them and you hardly notice anything at all. You redress carefully."
  "Scenes.Mutations.UpdateGills.AnemoneDone": "[pg]<b>You now have feathery gills!</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.UpdateGills.FishFromAnemone": "[pg]You feel your gills tingle, a vague numbness registering across their feathery exterior. You watch in awe as your gill's feathery folds dry out and fall off like crisp autumn leaves. The slits of your gills then rearrange themselves, becoming thinner and shorter, as they shift to the sides of your neck. They now close in a way that makes them almost invisible. As you run a finger over your neck you feel little more than several small raised lines where they meet your skin."
  "Scenes.Mutations.UpdateGills.FishFromNone": "[pg]You feel a sudden tingle on your neck. You reach up to it to feel around and find the source of the sensation. When you touch your neck, you feel that it begins to grow several narrow slits which slowly grow longer. After the changes have stopped you quickly head to a nearby puddle to take a closer look at your neck. You realize, that your neck has grown gills allowing you to breathe under water as if you were standing on land."
  "Scenes.Mutations.UpdateGills.FishDone": "[pg]<b>You now have fish like gills!</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.RemoveExtraBreastRow.Text": "[pg]You stumble back when your center of balance shifts, and though you adjust before you can fall over, you're left to watch in awe as your bottom-most [lastbreasts] shrink down, disappearing completely into your [if (breastrows >= 3) {abdomen|chest}]. The [lastnipples] even fade until nothing but [if (isFluffy) {[furColor] [skinDesc]|[skinTone] [skinDesc]}] remains. <b>You've lost a row of breasts!</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.Oviposition.Gained": "[pg]Deep inside yourself there is a change. It makes you feel a little woozy, but passes quickly. Beyond that, you aren't sure exactly what just happened, but you are sure it originated from your basilisk womb.\\n(<b>Perk Gained: Oviposition</b>)"
  "Scenes.Mutations.Oviposition.Lost": "[pg]Another change in your uterus ripples through your reproductive systems. Somehow you know you've lost a little bit of reptilian reproductive ability.\\n(<b>Perk Lost: Oviposition</b>)\\n"
  "Scenes.Mutations.GainDraconicHorns.Condense": "[pg]Your horns condense, twisting around each other and merging into larger, pointed protrusions. By the time they finish you have four draconic-looking horns, each about twelve inches long."
  "Scenes.Mutations.GainDraconicHorns.Warp": "[pg]You feel your horns changing and warping, and reach back to touch them. They have a slight curve and a gradual taper. They must look something like the horns the dragons in your village's legends always had."
  "Scenes.Mutations.GainDraconicHorns.Shrunk": " The change seems to have shrunken the horns, they're about a foot long now."
  "Scenes.Mutations.GainDraconicHorns.GrowPair": "[pg]With painful pressure, the skin on the sides of your forehead splits around two tiny nub-like horns. They're angled back in such a way as to resemble those you saw on the dragons in your village's legends. A few inches of horn sprout from your head before stopping. <b>You have about four inches of dragon-like horn.</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.GainDraconicHorns.Headache": "[pg]You get a headache as an inch of fresh horn escapes from your pounding skull."
  "Scenes.Mutations.GainDraconicHorns.Longer": "[pg]Your head aches as your horns grow a few inches longer. They get even thicker about the base, giving you a menacing appearance."
  "Scenes.Mutations.GainDraconicHorns.Settled": " <b>Your horns settle down quickly, as if they're reached their full size.</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.GainDraconicHorns.SecondRow": "[pg]A second row of horns erupts under the first, and though they are narrower, they grow nearly as long as your first row before they stop. A sense of finality settles over you. <b>You have as many horns as a {0} can grow.</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreArms.GooFeathers": "The feathers on your arms melt back into your now gooey skin."
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreArms.GooClawsToo": " Additionally your now gooey claws melt back into your fingers."
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreArms.GooClaws": "Your now gooey claws melt back into your fingers."
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreArms.GooClawsUseless": " Well, who cares, gooey claws aren't very useful in combat to begin with."
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreArms.HumanAgain": " <b>You have normal human arms again.</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreArms.ScratchBiceps": "\\n\\nYou scratch at your biceps absentmindedly, but no matter how much you scratch, it isn't getting rid of the itch."
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreArms.FromHarpy": " Glancing down in irritation, you discover that your feathery arms are shedding their feathery coating. The wing-like shape your arms once had is gone in a matter of moments, leaving [skinfurscales] behind."
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreArms.FromSpider": " Glancing down in irritation, you discover that your arms' chitinous covering is flaking away. The glossy black coating is soon gone, leaving [skinfurscales] behind."
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreArms.FromScaled": " Glancing down in irritation, you discover that your once scaly arms are shedding their scales and that your claws become normal human fingernails again."
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreArms.PredatorGoo": "\\n\\nYour gooey claws melt into your fingers. Well, who cares, gooey claws aren't very useful in combat to begin with."
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreArms.PredatorClaws": "\\n\\nYou feel a sudden tingle in your [claws] and then you realize, that they have become normal human fingernails again."
  "Scenes.Mutations.RestoreArms.Default": "\\n\\nYour unusual arms change more and more until they are normal human arms, leaving [skinfurscales] behind."
  "Scenes.Mutations.DemonChanges.TailFromInsect": "You feel a tingling in your insectile abdomen as it stretches, narrowing, the exoskeleton flaking off as it transforms into a flexible demon-tail, complete with a round spaded tip. "
  "Scenes.Mutations.DemonChanges.TailFromOther": "You feel a tingling in your tail. You are amazed to discover it has shifted into a flexible demon-tail, complete with a round spaded tip. "
  "Scenes.Mutations.DemonChanges.TailDemon": "<b>Your tail is now demonic in appearance.</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.DemonChanges.TailGrow": "[pg]A pain builds in your backside... growing more and more pronounced. The pressure suddenly disappears with a loud ripping and tearing noise. <b>You realize you now have a demon tail</b>... complete with a cute little spade."
  "Scenes.Mutations.DemonChanges.HornsFirst": "A small pair of demon horns erupts from your forehead. They actually look kind of cute. <b>You have horns!</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.DemonChanges.HornsSecond": "Another pair of demon horns, larger than the last, forms behind the first row."
  "Scenes.Mutations.DemonChanges.HornsShift": "Your horns shift, shrinking into two small demonic-looking horns."
  "Scenes.Mutations.DemonChanges.FaceHuman": "Your visage twists painfully, returning to a more normal human shape, albeit with flawless skin. <b>Your face is human again!</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.DemonChanges.DemonTongue": "[pg]Your snake-like tongue tingles, thickening in your mouth until it feels more like your old human tongue, at least for the first few inches. It bunches up inside you, and when you open up your mouth to release it, roughly two feet of tongue dangles out. You find it easy to move and control, as natural as walking. <b>You now have a long demon-tongue.</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.DemonChanges.FeetClaws": "Every muscle and sinew below your hip tingles and you begin to stagger. Seconds after you sit down, pain explodes in your [feet]. Something hard breaks through your sole from the inside out as your toes splinter and curve cruelly. The pain slowly diminishes and your eyes look along a human leg that splinters at the foot into a claw with sharp black nails. When you relax, your feet grip the ground easily. <b>Your feet are now formed into demonic claws.</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.DemonChanges.FeetHeels": "Every muscle and sinew below your hip tingles and you begin to stagger. Seconds after you sit down, pain explodes in your [feet]. Something hard breaks through your sole from the inside out. The pain slowly diminishes and your eyes look along a human leg to a thin and sharp horn protruding from the heel. When you relax, your feet are pointing down and their old posture is only possible with an enormous effort. <b>Your feet are now formed into demonic high-heels.</b> Tentatively you stand up and try to take a few steps. To your surprise you feel as if you were born with this and stride vigorously forward, hips swaying."
  "Scenes.Mutations.DemonChanges.WingsGrowLarge": "Your small demonic wings stretch and grow, tingling with the pleasure of being attached to such a tainted body. You stretch over your shoulder to stroke them as they unfurl, turning into full-sized demon-wings. <b>Your demonic wings have grown!</b>"
  "Scenes.Mutations.DemonChanges.WingsFromFin": "[pg]The muscles around your shoulders bunch up uncomfortably, changing to support the new bat-like wings growing from your back. You twist your head as far as you can for a look and realize your fin has changed into small bat-like demon-wings!"
  "Scenes.Mutations.DemonChanges.WingsGrowTiny": "A knot of pain forms in your shoulders as they tense up. With a surprising force, a pair of small demonic wings sprout from your back, ripping a pair of holes in the back of your [armor]. <b>You now have tiny demonic wings</b>."
  "Scenes.Mutations.DemonChanges.WingsChange": "The muscles around your shoulders bunch up uncomfortably, changing to support your wings as you feel their weight increasing. You twist your head as far as you can for a look and realize they've changed into "
  "Scenes.Mutations.DemonChanges.WingsSmall": "small "
  "Scenes.Mutations.DemonChanges.WingsLarge": "large "
  "Scenes.Mutations.DemonChanges.WingsBatlike": "<b>bat-like demon-wings!</b>"
}
